WEBVTT

00:11:27.266 --> 00:11:30.185
In our yards and our communities
and our cities,

00:11:30.185 --> 00:11:33.188
with our voices and our actions
and our innovations,

00:11:33.188 --> 00:11:35.566
we can find solutions

00:11:35.566 --> 00:11:38.569
and we can shift
the power paradigm of flooding.

00:11:39.278 --> 00:11:40.529
Thank you.